AetherEngine PGS seek backports (AE#1022)

Released in 7.63.0 and 7.66.0, respectively:
https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine/commit/09147805cf6efa6bab704b46a79772e56a4a5235
https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine/commit/333150fa89a55b3390345e6cd0600a74ac717a73

The targeted unreleased follow-up fences out a pre-seek batch that would reopen
a cue at the landing after the released departure fix:
https://github.com/superuser404notfound/AetherEngine/commit/1b8f1373b8fbadecc96aba5d3577a803f65849b9

Keep the vendor's existing prefetch policy, source deferral, and ASS cursor
replay. Cinema offers subtitle timing controls and uses the default reach.

